  "notes": "2025 standard deduction from the verified base and additional amounts. The basis names the uncomputed dependent's limited standard deduction and the uncomputed senior deduction.",
  "basis": {
    "said": [
      "Filing status, and whether the taxpayer or spouse is 65 or older or blind, are the return's own facts."
    ],
    "derived": [
      "The base amount is the 2025 standard deduction for the filing status.",
      "Each applicable age-65 or blindness box adds the 2025 additional amount for that filing status."
    ],
    "assumed": [
      "This line does not compute a limited deduction for a dependent and does not compute the senior deduction."
    ],
    "left_with_person": [
      "The dependent's limited standard deduction is not computed here; it applies when someone can claim the taxpayer as a dependent.",
      "The senior deduction on Schedule 1-A, for a person aged 65 or older, is not computed here."
    ]
  }
